      "message": "test(sim): the fixture band law's real-tilt case leans 3 degrees\n\nWith #1307 on main the 1.01e-9 rad lean of the r 15 holder no longer\nconvicts once the exact rim dip lands; the clamp is struck from about\n2.1 degrees on, so the real-tilt half of the test reads 3 degrees.\n\nRefs #1303\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
